     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"PERSONA-01\"> </a></b>Identify personas from L1 guidance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify personas referenced in L1 normative guidance.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"PERSONA-02\"> </a></b>Identify personas from SME consultations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify personas participating in workflows through consultations with SMEs.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"PERSONA-03\"> </a></b>Define persona competencies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define descriptions, competencies, and essential interventions performed by each persona.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"PERSONA-04\"> </a></b>Ensure cross-component consistency</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that the same persona names are used consistently across all DAK components.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"PERSONA-05\"> </a></b>Validate through facility interviews</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can validate personas through in-person interviews at health facilities.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorPersonas\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-PERSONA-01\"> </a></b>Identify personas from L1 guidance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify personas referenced in L1 normative guidance.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-PERSONA-02\"> </a></b>Identify personas from SME consultations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify personas participating in workflows through consultations with SMEs.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-PERSONA-03\"> </a></b>Define persona competenci